Study production, distribution, exchange, power, and political institutions together. Enter through a question about work, resources, money, a collective arrangement, or a historical change, and introduce the relevant concepts, accounts, evidence, and formal methods at the depth used. Compare explanations through Sociology, History, and Philosophy.

